    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HR Engagement Workflow\n\nThis workflow automates HR email communications by pulling data from Google Sheets and Google Calendar.  \n\n### **What it does**\n1. **Birthday Messages**  \n   - Checks the employee sheet for birthdays.  \n   - If today is someone’s birthday → sends a **personalized birthday email** only to that employee.  \n\n2. **Company Event Reminders**  \n   - Looks up company events in the \"Important Company Dates\" sheet.  \n   - If an event is **1 week away** → sends a reminder to all staff.  \n   - If an event is **today** → sends a \"happening today\" email to all staff.  \n\n3. **Holiday Greetings**  \n   - Pulls general holidays from the Google Calendar (Malaysia).  \n   - If today is a holiday → sends a **holiday greeting email** to all staff.  \n\n### **How it works**\n- Uses Google Sheets (employee birthdays & company events).  \n- Uses Google Calendar (public holidays).  \n- Uses OpenAI for drafting natural, friendly, and engaging email messages.  \n- Sends emails via Gmail (to individual employees or to all staff).   \n",
        "height": 976,
        "width": 816
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -960,
        -368
      ],
      "id": "b41472c1-5dba-4c50-80d7-162d041f213c",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
